<title>UK: LIG names David Davies finance director.</title>
<headline>LIG names David Davies finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>British-based condom and glove maker London International Group Plc said on Thursday that it had appointed David Davies as finance director with effect from November 1997.</p>
<p>Davies, who is currently vice president, finance and market development with The Disney Store Europe, will replace James Tyrrell, who is retiring.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
